            <note corresp="#d161-f3" n="3" xml:id="d161-f3-content">
                <p>This option is checked on the source text.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d161-f4" n="4" xml:id="d161-f4-content">
                <p>This option is checked on the source text. On April 18, Assistant Secretary
                        Palmer informed Foreign Minister
                    Bourguiba that the $15 million program loan had been authorized, and confirmed
                    the invitation for President Bourguiba to visit the United States in the latter
                    part of the year. (Memorandum of conversation; Department of State, Central
                    Files, POL TUN–US)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
